summary: Test Kdump by crashing kernel via NMI button
description: |
    It crashes the system via NMI switch
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - OpenIPMI 
  - ipmitool
duration: 30m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/crash-nmi-switch
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/crash-nmi-switch
